<title>USA: Philadelphia fiscal board cancels monthly meeting.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia fiscal board cancels monthly meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pennsylvania Intergovernmental Cooperation Authority, Philadelphia's fiscal oversight board, said Wednesday it cancelled its Nov 19 board meeting.</p>
<p>The next regularly scheduled meeting is Dec 17 at 1000 EST.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
